direction: down

ModelA: Model A（online） {
    style.stroke: blue
    style.bold: true
    
    SA0: segment 0
    SA1: segment 1
    SA2: segment 2
    
    SA0 -- SA1 -- SA2
}

Hold: 保留 memory layout\n不立即拆散 segments {
    style.stroke: orange
}

Reuse: Ownership Transfer {
    style.stroke: green
    style.bold: true
}

ModelB: Model B 直接写入原有 region {
    style.stroke: blue
}

ModelA -> Hold: A offline
Hold -> Reuse: B online\narchitecture compatible
Reuse -> ModelB
